{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Distance","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tree","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/ShortestPathTree","preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths0A8PathTreeV","text":"ShortestPathTree","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Distance","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Distance","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vertices are listed in the tree’s index order (the indices of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distance(toIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"graph’s vertex indices when it has them), unreached ones left out, so the source need not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come first. Edge positions are the arborescence’s own, in vertex order: edge k leads to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the k-th listed vertex other than the root, counting from 0. The graph’s edge into a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex stays "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tree.parentEdge(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":". O(n); the vertices are hashed once, into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arborescence’s lookup table, unless they are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<k"},{"type":"text","text":" in order."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"tree.sources.count == 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Several sources make a rooted forest, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trees has no type for; the source count is the caller’s own argument to the search, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking for one root with several is a programming error, not a lookup that may miss."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/Trees\/Arborescence\/init(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths","relatedModules":["Trees"]}],"externalID":"s:5Trees12ArborescenceV13ShortestPathsEyACyxGAD0C8PathTreeVyqd__qd_0_Gc6VertexQyd__Rsz14GraphProtocols08DirectedH0Rd__SLRd_0_r0_lufc","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShortestPathTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/ShortestPathTree.swift#L219"},"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Distance"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths0A8PathTreeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ShortestPathTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Distance"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"symbolKind":"init","title":"init(_:)","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Vertex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"extendedModule":"Trees","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/Trees","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/Trees\/Arborescence"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/trees\/arborescence\/init(_:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The shortest-path tree of a one-source search, as an arborescence rooted at the source:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every reached vertex, each with its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"parent(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" as parent (the tree LEMON’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"predMap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encodes)."}],"references":{"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/ShortestPathTree":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"ShortestPathTree","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ShortestPathTree","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Shortest paths from one or more sources: for each reached vertex, its distance, its parent and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":